     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "We offer special introductory prices to anybody wishing to discover the fun and manoeuvrability of a helicopter. Treat yourself! Or treat someone else - a trial lesson is the perfect present for those wanting to give a memorable and exciting gift experience to friends or family! "
    }
   ],
